{"tmdb":961214,"tagline":"I'll be back, alive.","synopsis":"Despite unwavering support from his best friend Young-ha and the unwavering support of his younger sister Ye-rin, job seeker Seok Hwan just can't seem to land a job, repeatedly failing interviews. One night, after yet another disastrous interview, he returns home only to be attacked by a group of strangers and killed. But 72 hours after his death, Seok Hwan suddenly opens his eyes as if nothing happened. He soon discovers that he possesses a special ability: no matter how many times he dies, he comes back to life. But there's little time to process his extraordinary new power before a mysterious figure known as Black, who has discovered Hwan's existence, begins hunting him down.  Yet with each resurrection, Seok Hwan grows stronger, unleashing powers beyond anything he could have imagined!","directors":[{"name":"Baek Jong-yeol","id":1480986}],"cast":[{"actor":"Koo Kyo-hwan","role":"Seok Hwan / Red","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aFwCpSKPGFqoiTStY6ljXnD5CwH.jpg","tmdb":1096458},{"actor":"Shin Seung-ho","role":"Black","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6Ca6UNuwVmHPIVGIPQuChOp7oJp.jpg","tmdb":2353469},{"actor":"Kang Ki-young","role":"Young-ha","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xjsYs1nOzw2zbyJtRwHzWRblFrA.jpg","tmdb":1648169},{"actor":"Kim Sia","role":"Cha Ye-rin","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4xNracGIzNRRLNbIO5cWigbPpCA.jpg","tmdb":2115785},{"actor":"Kim Sung-ryung","role":"Mi-joo","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sPB8ySlzfJWNedISwugRWEBABIY.jpg","tmdb":930417},{"actor":"Kim In-woo","role":"Cha Hyeong-seok","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zseVjncNOROGqZbJozlMTgFHeeI.jpg","tmdb":1830800},{"actor":"Kim Ji-yool","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/k2rlfDSRwnvAMmwDfGebx77HwaY.jpg","tmdb":5271324},{"actor":"Justin Harvey","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sB8FTFBs7xoiOCzbJM5X2vpi4Rr.jpg","tmdb":3570790},{"actor":"Kim Seung-beom","rol